script = ExtResource("3_rpffk")
sender = "Daisy"
subject = "Friendly Reminder about IT Requests!"
body = "Hi team,

Please remember to format your email signatures correctly. Your name should come first, then your title (in [i]italics[/i]), then the company name. I am noticing a lack of conformity across different teams and would really appreciate your cooperation in improving company cohesion.

..-. --- ..- .-. - .... / .... .- -. -.. / --- ..-. ..-. / -.- .. -- / - --- / .-.. . .- .... / .- - / ... . ...- . -. / .--. –

Hassan
[i]Communications Director[/i]
Parallax"
